OL,3,GNEWSAGuard boats move into position as
OL,4,Aexperts deal with unexploded WW2 bomb
OL,5,Afound in docks
OL,6,
OL,7,FA "flurry of activity" was reported at
OL,8,Fabout 15:30 as guard boats moved into
OL,9,Fposition in the docks, with onlookers
OL,10,Ftaking to Cliff Road with binoculars
OL,12,FGWR has suspended it train services
OL,13,Fbetween Falmouth Docks and Falmouth
OL,14,FTown stations, with disruption expected
OL,15,Funtil the cordon is removed
OL,17,FAn evacuation centre has been set up at
OL,18,FAll Saints Church in Killigrew Street
OL,19,Fwith a variety of biscuits, tea, coffee
OL,20,Fand phone chargers on hand for anyone
OL,21,Fdisplaced
